COMPILATION OF: E48A15

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48A15

   1 a 0000 E48A15:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P1] `put list(b)' on a BIT(1).  No DR object in the
   4 a 0006      tree prints a bit string and my refusal text says so; this
   5 a 0006      probe turns that absence-of-witness into a MEASUREMENT.  A
   6 a 0006      .REL here would open a bit-output route this compiler has
   7 a 0006      never lowered; `COMP REQ ?' here is a dr-refuses row. */
   8 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('1'b);
   9 c 0006   put list(b);
  10 c 001D   stop;
  11 a 0020 end E48A15;

CODE SIZE = 0020
DATA AREA = 0001
FREE SYMS = 38DB
END  COMPILATION
